sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Voice UI
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant STT as STT Service
    participant Graph as LangGraph Agent
    participant Tool as Todo Tool
    participant DB as Database

    User->>UI: Speaks morning plan
    UI->>API: Upload audio
    API->>STT: Transcribe audio
    STT-->>API: Transcript
    API->>Graph: Run graph with transcript
    Graph->>Graph: Classify intent as add_todo
    Graph->>Graph: Extract task fields
    Graph->>Tool: create_tasks(tasks)
    Tool->>DB: Insert pending tasks
    DB-->>Tool: Created tasks
    Tool-->>Graph: Tool result
    Graph-->>API: Response text and task list
    API-->>UI: Transcript, response, tasks
    UI-->>User: Displays response and tasks
